    <div>
      <p begin="00:01.206" end="00:02.706" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:02.541" end="00:08.994" ttm:agent="v1">Yeah, ayy, yeah, ayy, yeah, okay, yeah</p>
      <p begin="00:08.994" end="00:12.579" ttm:agent="v1">Wait, hold on bro, who the **** keep callin' my phone?</p>
      <p begin="00:12.579" end="00:14.079" ttm:agent="v1">Ayy, nevermind, **** this b***h</p>
      <p begin="00:13.556" end="00:16.201" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">One, two, three bad b*****s sippin' Lipton (Yeah, yeah, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="00:16.201" end="00:18.977" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Pulled up with your b*****s then we loved and we dipped in (Yeah, ayy, yeah)</p>
      <p begin="00:18.977" end="00:21.807" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Niggas, they be cappin' on they chinny-chin, Crimson (Yeah, what?)</p>
      <p begin="00:21.807" end="00:24.506" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I'ma **** this thot like a GTA, she missioned (Yeah, what?)</p>
      <p begin="00:24.506" end="00:27.445" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">And my bros booted up off the gas (Uh, where? Where?)</p>
      <p begin="00:27.445" end="00:30.142" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">And she bad (Ooh), shawty shakin' ass (Where?)</p>
      <p begin="00:30.142" end="00:32.973" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">In L.A. with Bia , he'll hit the dash (Skrr, skrr)</p>
      <p begin="00:32.973" end="00:35.824" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I just called my clans, wе can clash (Baow)</p>
      <p begin="00:35.824" end="00:39.194" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I get hella lit (Yeah), I'm a frat boy (Yеah)</p>
      <p begin="00:39.194" end="00:40.694" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Frat boy (Frat boy)</p>
      <p begin="00:40.679" end="00:43.747" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Feel like Batman, I'm a bat, boy (I'm a bat, boy)</p>
      <p begin="00:43.747" end="00:46.539" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Pull up with them sticks, we keep them bats, boy (Frrah, frrah)</p>
      <p begin="00:46.539" end="00:49.057" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Niggas keep them tools, we never lack, boy (Frrah, frrah)</p>
      <p begin="00:49.057" end="00:51.876" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">And you said you bangin', that's an act, boy (Act, boy)</p>
      <p begin="00:51.876" end="00:54.708" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">'Cause when we saw your crew, you was track, boy (Nyoom)</p>
      <p begin="00:54.708" end="00:57.353" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">You had turned on your gang, ain't comin' back, boy (Nah)</p>
      <p begin="00:57.353" end="01:00.007" ttm:agent="v1">Smokin' big woods, not no black, boy</p>
      <p begin="01:00.007" end="01:01.507" ttm:agent="v1">Not no black, boy</p>
      <p begin="01:01.272" end="01:04.109" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">One, two, three bad b*****s sippin' Lipton (Yeah, yeah, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="01:04.109" end="01:06.616" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Pulled up with your b*****s then we loved and we dipped in (Yeah, ayy, yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:06.616" end="01:09.356" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Niggas, they be cappin' on they chinny-chin, Crimson (Yeah, what?)</p>
      <p begin="01:09.356" end="01:12.236" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I'ma **** this thot like a GTA, she missioned (Yeah, ayy, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="01:12.236" end="01:14.983" ttm:agent="v1">I'ma check these niggas like I work for Nike, they won't like me</p>
      <p begin="01:14.983" end="01:17.631" ttm:agent="v1">Put your fist up, sticks down, come and fight me</p>
      <p begin="01:17.631" end="01:20.775" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">This a Phantom, ho, I can't go broke, b***h, I'm rich (Can't go broke, b***h)</p>
      <p begin="01:20.775" end="01:23.544" ttm:agent="v1">I'm a lick, I'm a walking brick, yeah, that be your b***h</p>
      <p begin="01:23.544" end="01:26.086" ttm:agent="v1">On my lick, I'm a rockstar, yeah, I'm rockin' shit</p>
      <p begin="01:26.086" end="01:28.940" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">In a coupe, I can't even lose, I be with your boo (Uh-uh)</p>
      <p begin="01:28.940" end="01:31.687" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Talkin' shit, end up on the news, I got plenty tools (Where? Where? Where?)</p>
      <p begin="01:31.687" end="01:34.649" ttm:agent="v1">I jewels makin' money too, this the life I live</p>
      <p begin="01:34.649" end="01:37.477" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I can't choose, I got plenty moves, everything legit (Yeah, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="01:37.477" end="01:40.554" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">One, two, three bad b*****s sippin' Lipton (Yeah, yeah, ayy)</p>
      <p begin="01:40.554" end="01:43.175" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Pulled up with your b*****s then we loved and we dipped in (Yeah, ayy, yeah)</p>
      <p begin="01:43.175" end="01:46.034" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Niggas, they be cappin' on they chinny-chin, Crimson (Yeah, what?)</p>
      <p begin="01:46.034" end="01:48.608" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I'ma **** this thot like a GTA, she missioned (Yeah, what?)</p>
      <p begin="01:48.608" end="01:51.503" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I'ma **** this thot, she a treesh, pourin' Wockhardt (Ayy)</p>
      <p begin="01:51.503" end="01:54.497" ttm:agent="v1">***** boy throwin' signs on Twitter, boy, you're not hard</p>
      <p begin="01:54.497" end="01:57.375" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Calabasas (feat. $NOT), You could get your face fist-****ed you play your cards right (****</p>
      <p begin="01:57.375" end="02:01.375" ttm:agent="v1">I'm a lil' kid, I like to eat Pop-Tarts</p>
